  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Core Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into the core components, starting with `/src/components/questions/QuestionCard.tsx`. This will be the flagship Question Solver card. The first task is to nail down the unboxed, zero-pill clinical metadata header, like `Q-USP25-0142 \302\267 USP-`. I need to ensure that the header structure and metadata are exactly what\'s required for the platform.\n\n\n**Refining Clinical Vignettes**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the display of clinical vignettes. I want to incorporate an optimal reading measure (`max-w-[75ch]`) to ensure readability. I also need a structured laboratory table with tabular numerals and clear semantic indicators for high/low values. For images, I\'m thinking of an interactive `ClinicalImageViewer` with PACS zoom. I also have an improved user experience in mind for the alternative options, including a strikethrough option, doubt flags, and a bookmarking feature. After submitting, I plan to display community distribution bars for each alternative.\n\n\n**Designing Performance Dashboard**\n\nI\'m now integrating a summary bar above the commentary, showing global accuracy, total responders, calculated level, and the principal distractor. I\'m also structuring didactic commentary with tabs for alternative analysis, clinical pearls, and bibliographic references. Next, I\'m working on the Performance Dashboard, starting with a 4-column KPI strip and a main comparison chart with toggleable granularity and chart types.\n\n\n**Visualizing Key Metrics**\n\nI\'m now focusing on data visualization. I\'m prioritizing the comparison of student performance against community medians and top performers using grouped bar charts and radar charts. I\'m also developing a temporal evolution chart with weekly and monthly toggles, comparing the student learning curve against the community median and top performers. I will also include a detailed, sortable table for analytical purposes. This will incorporate clickable headers for sorting and a view filter. Finally, I\'m working on a live ranking widget to display top online students.\n\n\n**Implementing Live Ranking**\n\nI\'m now integrating live ranking features. I\'ve designed a dedicated view for real-time ranking and privacy settings, including a complete leaderboard showing the top 10+ online students with a weighted score breakdown. I\'m also working on an \"Identidade e Privacidade no Ranking\" panel for user control over real names versus pseudonyms, custom nicknames, random codename generation, and editable target institution/specialty. I\'m also including visual indicators for online status, weighted scores, questions attempted today, and accuracy percentages, and if ranked outside the top 10, I\'ll provide a dedicated view, showing the user the rank with a divider.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "SCUCa7KsC6fRz7IP8Kr3oAI"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_17416077171045077584"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useMemo, useState, useEffect } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  Bookmark,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  XCircle,\\n  AlertTriangle,\\n  Strikethrough,\\n  Flag,\\n  ChevronLeft,\\n  ChevronRight,\\n  BookOpen,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  FileText,\\n  Users,\\n  ArrowUp,\\n  ArrowDown,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type {\\n  AlternativeLetter,\\n  MedicalQuestion,\\n  StudyMode,\\n  UserAnswerRecord,\\n} from \'../../types/medical\';\\nimport { computeDifficulty, cn } from \'../../lib/utils\';\\nimport { ClinicalImageViewer } from \'./ClinicalImageViewer\';\\nimport { Button } from \'../ui/Button\';\\n\\ninterface QuestionCardProps {\\n  question: MedicalQuestion;\\n  index: number;\\n  total: number;\\n  mode: StudyMode;\\n  existingAnswer?: UserAnswerRecord;\\n  simuladoDraft?: AlternativeLetter;\\n  simuladoFinished: boolean;\\n  isBookmarked: boolean;\\n  isFlagged: boolean;\\n  onToggleBookmark: () => void;\\n  onToggleFlag: () => void;\\n  onSubmitStudyAnswer: (letter: AlternativeLetter) => void;\\n  onSelectSimuladoDraft: (letter: AlternativeLetter) => void;\\n  onPrev: () => void;\\n  onNext: () => void;\\n}\\n\\ntype CommentaryTab = \'alternativas\' | \'perola\' | \'referencias\';\\n\\nexport function QuestionCard({\\n  question,\\n  index,\\n  total,\\n  mode,\\n  existingAnswer,\\n  simuladoDraft,\\n  simuladoFinished,\\n  isBookmarked,\\n  isFlagged,\\n  onToggleBookmark,\\n  onToggleFlag,\\n  onSubmitStudyAnswer,\\n  onSelectSimuladoDraft,\\n  onPrev,\\n  onNext,\\n}: QuestionCardProps) {\\n  const [selectedPending, setSelectedPending] = useState<AlternativeLetter | null>(null);\\n  const [eliminated, setEliminated] = useState<AlternativeLetter[]>([]);\\n  const [commentTab, setCommentTab] = useState<CommentaryTab>(\'alternativas\');\\n\\n  // Reset local pending state when navigating to a new question\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    setSelectedPending(null);\\n    setEliminated([]);\\n    setCommentTab(\'alternativas\');\\n  }, [question.id]);\\n\\n  const isRevealed =\\n    (mode === \'estudo\' && Boolean(existingAnswer)) ||\\n    (mode === \'simulado\' && simuladoFinished);\\n\\n  const activeChoice: AlternativeLetter | null =\\n    mode === \'simulado\'\\n      ? simuladoDraft ?? null\\n      : existingAnswer?.selectedLetter ?? selectedPending;\\n\\n  const difficulty = computeDifficulty(question.taxaAcertoGlobal);\\n\\n  // Identify Principal Distrator (highest community % among WRONG options)\\n  const principalDistractor = useMemo(() => {\\n    const wrongOptions = question.alternativas.filter(\\n      (a) => a.letter !== question.gabaritoOficial\\n    );\\n    return wrongOptions.reduce(\\n      (best, cur) => (cur.communityPct > best.communityPct ? cur : best),\\n      wrongOptions[0]\\n    );\\n  }, [question]);\\n\\n  const toggleEliminate = (letter: AlternativeLetter, e: React.MouseEvent) => {\\n    e.stopPropagation();\\n    if (isRevealed) return;\\n    setEliminated((prev) =>\\n      prev.includes(letter) ? prev.filter((l) => l !== letter) : [...prev, letter]\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleOptionClick = (letter: AlternativeLetter) => {\\n    if (isRevealed) return;\\n    if (eliminated.includes(letter)) return;\\n    if (mode === \'simulado\') {\\n      onSelectSimuladoDraft(letter);\\n    } else {\\n      setSelectedPending(letter);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleConfirmStudy = () => {\\n    if (!selectedPending || mode !== \'estudo\') return;\\n    onSubmitStudyAnswer(selectedPending);\\n  };\\n\\n  const isUserCorrect =\\n    isRevealed && activeChoice === question.gabaritoOficial;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <article className=\\\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900\\\">\\n      {/* Header Metadata Line \342\200\224 Clean unboxed typography with separators */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 px-5 py-4 sm:px-7 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-1 min-w-0\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 tabular-nums\\\">\\n              Quest\303\243o {index + 1} de {total}\\n            </span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"font-mono\\\">{question.code}</span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n              {question.instituicao} {question.ano}\\n            </span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span>{question.banca}</span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span>{question.tipoProva}</span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span\\n              className={cn(\\n                \'font-medium\',\\n                difficulty === \'F\303\241cil\' && \'text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\',\\n                difficulty === \'M\303\251dio\' && \'text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\',\\n                difficulty === \'Dif\303\255cil\' && \'text-red-700 dark:text-red-400\'\\n              )}\\n            >\\n              {difficulty}\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-400\\\">\\n            {question.grandeArea}{\' \'}\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600\\\">/</span>{\' \'}\\n            {question.tema}{\' \'}\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600\\\">/</span>{\' \'}\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-normal\\\">\\n              {question.subtema}\\n            </span>\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Utility actions: Flag for review (simulado) & Bookmark (Caderno de Erros) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0\\\">\\n          {mode === \'simulado\' && !simuladoFinished && (\\n            <Button\\n              variant={isFlagged ? \'secondary\' : \'ghost\'}\\n              size=\\\"sm\\\"\\n              onClick={onToggleFlag}\\n              className={cn(\\n                isFlagged && \'text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300\'\\n              )}\\n            >\\n              <Flag\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \'h-3.5 w-3.5\',\\n                  isFlagged && \'fill-amber-500 text-amber-500\'\\n                )}\\n              />\\n              <span>{isFlagged ? \'Revisar depois\' : \'Marcar d\303\272vida\'}</span>\\n            </Button>\\n          )}\\n\\n          <Button\\n            variant=\\\"ghost\\\"\\n            size=\\\"sm\\\"\\n            onClick={onToggleBookmark}\\n            aria-pressed={isBookmarked}\\n            className={cn(\\n              isBookmarked && \'text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-400\'\\n            )}\\n          >\\n            <Bookmark\\n              className={cn(\\n                \'h-4 w-4\',\\n                isBookmarked && \'fill-sky-600 text-sky-600 dark:fill-sky-400 dark:text-sky-400\'\\n              )}\\n            />\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">\\n              {isBookmarked ? \'No Caderno\' : \'Salvar\'}\\n            </span>\\n          </Button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Notice banner if Annulled or Outdated */}\\n      {(question.anulada || question.desatualizada) && (\\n        <div className=\\\"mx-5 mt-5 sm:mx-7 flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/70 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-amber-900 dark:border-amber-900/60 dark:bg-amber-950/30 dark:text-amber-200\\\">\\n          <AlertTriangle className=\\\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\\\" />\\n          <p>\\n            <strong>\\n              {question.anulada ? \'Quest\303\243o anulada pela banca oficial.\' : \'Quest\303\243o marcada como desatualizada.\'}\\n            </strong>{\' \'}\\n            Ative o filtro &ldquo;Excluir anuladas/desatualizadas&rdquo; para remov\303\252-la da sua lista de treino.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Question Stem (75ch optimal reading measure) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"px-5 py-6 sm:px-7\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"max-w-[75ch] space-y-5\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-[15.5px] sm:text-base leading-[1.72] text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n            {question.enunciado}\\n          </p>\\n\\n          {/* Optional Clinical Image with Zoom Lightbox */}\\n          {question.clinicalImage && (\\n            <ClinicalImageViewer image={question.clinicalImage} />\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Optional Structured Lab Table */}\\n          {question.labTable && question.labTable.length > 0 && (\\n            <div className=\\\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n              <table className=\\\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\\\">\\n                <thead className=\\\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950/60 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  <tr>\\n                    <th className=\\\"px-4 py-2.5 font-semibold\\\">Exame Laboratorial</th>\\n                    <th className=\\\"px-4 py-2.5 font-semibold text-right\\\">Resultado</th>\\n                    <th className=\\\"px-4 py-2.5 font-semibold text-right\\\">Refer\303\252ncia</th>\\n                  </tr>\\n                </thead>\\n                <tbody className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800/80\\\">\\n                  {question.labTable.map((row) => (\\n                    <tr\\n                      key={row.exame}\\n                      className=\\\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-50/70 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/40\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <td className=\\\"px-4 py-2.5 font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                        {row.exame}\\n                      </td>\\n                      <td className=\\\"px-4 py-2.5 text-right font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                        <span\\n                          className={cn(\\n                            \'inline-flex items-center justify-end gap-1 font-semibold\',\\n                            row.alterado === \'alto\' && \'text-red-700 dark:text-red-400\',\\n                            row.alterado === \'baixo\' && \'text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-400\',\\n                            (!row.alterado || row.alterado === \'normal\') &&\\n                              \'text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\'\\n                          )}\\n                        >\\n                          {row.alterado === \'alto\' && (\\n                            <ArrowUp className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" aria-label=\\\"Elevado\\\" />\\n                          )}\\n                          {row.alterado === \'baixo\' && (\\n                            <ArrowDown className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" aria-label=\\\"Reduzido\\\" />\\n                          )}\\n                          {row.resultado}\\n                        </span>\\n                      </td>\\n                      <td className=\\\"px-4 py-2.5 text-right font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                        {row.referencia}\\n                      </td>\\n                    </tr>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tbody>\\n              </table>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Alternatives List (with Strikethrough & Inline Community Percentage Bars on reveal) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-7 space-y-2.5\\\" role=\\\"radiogroup\\\" aria-label=\\\"Alternativas da quest\303\243o\\\">\\n          {question.alternativas.map((alt) => {\\n            const isEliminated = eliminated.includes(alt.letter);\\n            const isSelected = activeChoice === alt.letter;\\n            const isOfficial = alt.letter === question.gabaritoOficial;\\n            const isWrongChosen = isRevealed && isSelected && !isOfficial;\\n            const isPrincipalDistractor =\\n              isRevealed &&\\n              !isOfficial &&\\n              principalDistractor?.letter === alt.letter;\\n\\n            return (\\n              <div\\n                key={alt.letter}\\n                onClick={() => handleOptionClick(alt.letter)}\\n                role=\\\"radio\\\"\\n                aria-checked={isSelected}\\n                tabIndex={isRevealed ? -1 : 0}\\n                onKeyDown={(e) => {\\n                  if (e.key === \'Enter\' || e.key === \' \') {\\n                    e.preventDefault();\\n                    handleOptionClick(alt.letter);\\n                  }\\n                }}\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \'group relative rounded-xl border px-4 py-3.5 transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-sky-500\',\\n                  !isRevealed && !isEliminated && \'cursor-pointer\',\\n                  !isRevealed && isEliminated && \'opacity-50 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950/40\',\\n                  !isRevealed &&\\n                    isSelected &&\\n                    \'border-sky-500 bg-sky-50/70 dark:border-sky-400 dark:bg-sky-950/30\',\\n                  !isRevealed &&\\n                    !isSelected &&\\n                    !isEliminated &&\\n                    \'border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50/60 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:hover:border-slate-700 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/50\',\\n                  isRevealed &&\\n                    isOfficial &&\\n                    \'border-emerald-300 bg-emerald-50/60 dark:border-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-950/30\',\\n                  isRevealed &&\\n                    isWrongChosen &&\\n                    \'border-red-300 bg-red-50/60 dark:border-red-800 dark:bg-red-950/30\',\\n                  isRevealed &&\\n                    !isOfficial &&\\n                    !isWrongChosen &&\\n                    \'border-slate-200 bg-white dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900\'\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-start gap-3.5\\\">\\n                  {/* Letter Circle */}\\n                  <span\\n                    className={cn(\\n                      \'mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border font-mono text-xs font-bold transition-colors\',\\n                      !isRevealed &&\\n                        isSelected &&\\n                        \'border-sky-600 bg-sky-600 text-white dark:border-sky-400 dark:bg-sky-400 dark:text-slate-950\',\\n                      !isRevealed &&\\n                        !isSelected &&\\n                        \'border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300\',\\n                      isRevealed &&\\n                        isOfficial &&\\n                        \'border-emerald-600 bg-emerald-600 text-white dark:border-emerald-500 dark:bg-emerald-500 dark:text-slate-950\',\\n                      isRevealed &&\\n                        isWrongChosen &&\\n                        \'border-red-600 bg-red-600 text-white dark:border-red-500 dark:bg-red-500 dark:text-white\',\\n                      isRevealed &&\\n                        !isOfficial &&\\n                        !isWrongChosen &&\\n                        \'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-500 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                    )}\\n                  >\\n                    {alt.letter}\\n                  </span>\\n\\n                  {/* Alternative Text + Post-Answer Community Distribution Bar */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-2\\\">\\n                    <p\\n                      className={cn(\\n                        \'max-w-[75ch] text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100\',\\n                        isEliminated && !isRevealed && \'line-through text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500\'\\n                      )}\\n                    >\\n                      {alt.text}\\n                    </p>\\n\\n                    {/* Community Distribution Bar per Alternative (revealed post-answer) */}\\n                    {isRevealed && (\\n                      <div className=\\\"pt-1 space-y-1.5\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs\\\">\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 font-medium\\\">\\n                            {isOfficial && (\\n                              <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\\\">\\n                                <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                                <span>Gabarito oficial</span>\\n                              </span>\\n                            )}\\n                            {isWrongChosen && (\\n                              <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-700 dark:text-red-400\\\">\\n                                <XCircle className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                                <span>Sua escolha</span>\\n                              </span>\\n                            )}\\n                            {isPrincipalDistractor && (\\n                              <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\\\">\\n                                <AlertTriangle className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                                <span>Principal distrator</span>\\n                              </span>\\n                            )}\\n                            {!isOfficial && !isWrongChosen && !isPrincipalDistractor && (\\n                              <span className=\\\"text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                                Alternativa incorreta\\n                              </span>\\n                            )}\\n                          </div>\\n\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-mono font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                            {alt.communityPct.toFixed(1)}% dos alunos\\n                          </span>\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        <div className=\\\"h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800\\\">\\n                          <div\\n                            className={cn(\\n                              \'h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\',\\n                              isOfficial && \'bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-emerald-500\',\\n                              isWrongChosen && \'bg-red-500 dark:bg-red-500\',\\n                              !isOfficial &&\\n                                !isWrongChosen &&\\n                                isPrincipalDistractor &&\\n                                \'bg-amber-500 dark:bg-amber-400\',\\n                              !isOfficial &&\\n                                !isWrongChosen &&\\n                                !isPrincipalDistractor &&\\n                                \'bg-slate-400 dark:bg-slate-600\'\\n                            )}\\n                            style={{ width: `${Math.max(alt.communityPct, 1.5)}%` }}\\n                          />\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Eliminate / Strikethrough affordance */}\\n                  {!isRevealed && (\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={(e) => toggleEliminate(alt.letter, e)}\\n                      title={\\n                        isEliminated\\n                          ? \'Restaurar alternativa\'\\n                          : \'Riscar / eliminar alternativa\'\\n                      }\\n                      aria-label={\\n                        isEliminated\\n                          ? `Restaurar alternativa ${alt.letter}`\\n                          : `Riscar alternativa ${alt.letter}`\\n                      }\\n                      className={cn(\\n                        \'shrink-0 rounded-lg p-1.5 transition-colors cursor-pointer\',\\n                        isEliminated\\n                          ? \'bg-slate-200 text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100\'\\n                          : \'text-slate-400 opacity-70 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-700 hover:opacity-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                      )}\\n                    >\\n                      <Strikethrough className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n                    </button>\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Action Bar: Submit Study Answer + Prev/Next Navigation */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-5 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            {mode === \'estudo\' && !isRevealed && (\\n              <Button\\n                variant=\\\"primary\\\"\\n                size=\\\"md\\\"\\n                disabled={!selectedPending}\\n                onClick={handleConfirmStudy}\\n              >\\n                Responder quest\303\243o\\n              </Button>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {isRevealed && (\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold\\\">\\n                {isUserCorrect ? (\\n                  <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\\\">\\n                    <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n                    <span>Voc\303\252 acertou \342\200\224 Gabarito {question.gabaritoOficial}</span>\\n                  </span>\\n                ) : activeChoice ? (\\n                  <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-red-700 dark:text-red-400\\\">\\n                    <XCircle className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n                    <span>\\n                      Voc\303\252 marcou {activeChoice} \302\267 Gabarito oficial:{\' \'}\\n                      {question.gabaritoOficial}\\n                    </span>\\n                  </span>\\n                ) : (\\n                  <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                    <span>Em branco \302\267 Gabarito oficial: {question.gabaritoOficial}</span>\\n                  </span>\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {mode === \'simulado\' && !simuladoFinished && (\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                {simuladoDraft\\n                  ? `Alternativa ${simuladoDraft} registrada para entrega`\\n                  : \'Selecione uma alternativa ou risque distratores\'}\\n              </span>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <Button\\n              variant=\\\"outline\\\"\\n              size=\\\"sm\\\"\\n              onClick={onPrev}\\n              disabled={index <= 0}\\n            >\\n              <ChevronLeft className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n              <span>Anterior</span>\\n            </Button>\\n            <Button\\n              variant=\\\"outline\\\"\\n              size=\\\"sm\\\"\\n              onClick={onNext}\\n              disabled={index >= total - 1}\\n            >\\n              <span>Pr\303\263xima</span>\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n            </Button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Community Statistics & Didactic Commentary Panel (Revealed Post-Answer) */}\\n      {isRevealed && (\\n        <div className=\\\"border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 px-5 py-6 sm:px-7 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950/50 space-y-6\\\">\\n          {/* Community Crossing Metrics Row */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pb-5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Taxa Global de Acertos\\n              </p>\\n              <p className=\\\"mt-1 font-mono text-xl font-bold tabular-nums text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\\\">\\n                {question.taxaAcertoGlobal.toFixed(1)}%\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Principal Distrator\\n              </p>\\n              <p className=\\\"mt-1 font-mono text-xl font-bold tabular-nums text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\\\">\\n                Alt. {principalDistractor?.letter}{\' \'}\\n                <span className=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">\\n                  ({principalDistractor?.communityPct.toFixed(1)}%)\\n                </span>\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Dificuldade Din\303\242mica\\n              </p>\\n              <p className=\\\"mt-1 font-display text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                {difficulty}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Respostas na Plataforma\\n              </p>\\n              <p className=\\\"mt-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-base font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                <Users className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                {question.totalRespostasComunidade.toLocaleString(\'pt-BR\')}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Didactic Commentary Navigation */}\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-200/70 p-1 w-fit dark:bg-slate-800\\\">\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setCommentTab(\'alternativas\')}\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \'inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\',\\n                  commentTab === \'alternativas\'\\n                    ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-sm dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-white\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                <BookOpen className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Coment\303\241rio por Alternativa</span>\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setCommentTab(\'perola\')}\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \'inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\',\\n                  commentTab === \'perola\'\\n                    ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-sm dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-white\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                <Sparkles className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>P\303\251rola Cl\303\255nica</span>\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setCommentTab(\'referencias\')}\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \'inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\',\\n                  commentTab === \'referencias\'\\n                    ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-sm dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-white\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                <FileText className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Refer\303\252ncias ({question.referencias.length})</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {commentTab === \'alternativas\' && (\\n              <div className=\\\"max-w-[75ch] space-y-5\\\">\\n                <p className=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                  {question.comentarioGeral}\\n                </p>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-200 border-t border-slate-200 dark:divide-slate-800 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                  {question.alternativas.map((alt) => {\\n                    const correct = alt.letter === question.gabaritoOficial;\\n                    return (\\n                      <div key={alt.letter} className=\\\"py-3.5 space-y-1\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold\\\">\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-mono text-slate-900 dark:text-white\\\">\\n                            Alternativa {alt.letter}\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">\\n                            \302\267\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span\\n                            className={\\n                              correct\\n                                ? \'text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\'\\n                                : \'text-red-700 dark:text-red-400\'\\n                            }\\n                          >\\n                            {correct ? \'Correta\' : \'Incorreta\'}\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">\\n                            \302\267\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                            {alt.communityPct.toFixed(1)}%\\n                          </span>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <p className=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                          {alt.explanation}\\n                        </p>\\n                      </div>\\n                    );\\n                  })}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {commentTab === \'perola\' && (\\n              <div className=\\\"max-w-[75ch] rounded-xl border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50/70 p-5 dark:border-sky-900/60 dark:bg-sky-950/30\\\">\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-300 mb-2\\\">\\n                  Ponto-Chave para Revis\303\243o R\303\241pida\\n                </p>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                  {question.perolaClinica}\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {commentTab === \'referencias\' && (\\n              <div className=\\\"max-w-[75ch] space-y-2.5\\\">\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  Bibliografia e Diretrizes Oficiais\\n                </p>\\n                <ul className=\\\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                  {question.referencias.map((ref) => (\\n                    <li key={ref}>{ref}</li>\\n                  ))}\\n                </ul>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </article>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create QuestionCard with clinical image zoom, lab tables, strikethrough, inline option-level community percentage bars, and structured didactic commentary\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/questions/QuestionCard.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating QuestionCard component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create QuestionCard component\"}"
