  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining UI Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m continuing to refine the UI aesthetics, drawing on the already loaded `frontend-design` considerations. The focus remains on a clean, single-elevation surface, eschewing thick left borders and static pill boxes. Tabular numerals and explicit icon usage are also central to the approach.\n\n\n**Analyzing User Requirement**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the user\'s requirement, aiming for absolute clarity. I need to understand precisely what they envision for the resolved question view, especially the immediate comparison of the student\'s success rate against the community median. I\'m focusing on the \"simple progress indicator\" aspect. Next, I am going to examine relevant data in `store.analytics` and the `QuestionCard` component, to prepare for implementation.\n\n\n**Designing Progress Display**\n\nI\'m now designing a visual progress comparison, aiming for a clean, single-elevation component within the `QuestionCard.tsx`. The goal is an intuitive display that quickly shows the student\'s performance versus the community median. The title will be \"**Seu Desempenho vs. Mediana da Comunidade**\" with context like `{tema} \302\267 {answered} quest\303\265es`. I\'m planning an inline toggle for \"Neste tema\" vs \"Na Grande \303\201rea\" or \"Geral\" comparisons, defaulting to the specific topic. There will be a clean progress indicator bar to show the comparison, and the entire thing must be sharp.\n\n\n**Visualizing Performance Metrics**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the visual representation, focusing on a clear, single-elevation progress track. This will show the student\'s accuracy rate (`studentPct%`) with semantic color-coding and a precise vertical marker for the community median (P50).  I\'m aiming for tabular metrics below: `Voc\303\252: XX,X%`, `Mediana (P50): YY,Y%`, `Delta: +/-Z,Z%`, with a status icon and text (`Acima`, `Na`, or `Ponto de Aten\303\247\303\243o`). No pill boxes or thick borders.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "6yYCa9qlNefVjMcP9cfn8Q0"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5652006306879582732"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { TrendingUp, TrendingDown, Minus } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type { PerformanceStatus } from \'../../types/medical\';\\nimport { cn, formatDelta } from \'../../lib/utils\';\\n\\nexport interface BenchmarkSlice {\\n  label: string;\\n  studentPct: number;\\n  communityMedianPct: number;\\n  delta: number;\\n  status: PerformanceStatus;\\n  answered: number;\\n}\\n\\ninterface StudentVsMedianBarProps {\\n  topicBenchmark: BenchmarkSlice;\\n  areaBenchmark: BenchmarkSlice;\\n  overallBenchmark: BenchmarkSlice;\\n}\\n\\ntype Scope = \'tema\' | \'area\' | \'geral\';\\n\\nexport function StudentVsMedianBar({\\n  topicBenchmark,\\n  areaBenchmark,\\n  overallBenchmark,\\n}: StudentVsMedianBarProps) {\\n  const [scope, setScope] = useState<Scope>(\'tema\');\\n\\n  const current =\\n    scope === \'tema\'\\n      ? topicBenchmark\\n      : scope === \'area\'\\n      ? areaBenchmark\\n      : overallBenchmark;\\n\\n  const clampedStudent = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, current.studentPct));\\n  const clampedMedian = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, current.communityMedianPct));\\n\\n  const isAbove = current.status === \'Acima da Mediana\';\\n  const isBelow = current.status === \'Ponto de Aten\303\247\303\243o\';\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      aria-label=\\\"Comparativo imediato da taxa de acerto do aluno versus mediana da comunidade\\\"\\n      className=\\\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 space-y-3.5\\\"\\n    >\\n      {/* Header row with scope switch */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n          <h3 className=\\\"font-display text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\\\">\\n            Voc\303\252 vs. Mediana da Comunidade\\n          </h3>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 truncate tabular-nums\\\">\\n            {current.label} \302\267 {current.answered} quest\303\265es contabilizadas\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"inline-flex rounded-lg bg-slate-100 p-0.5 dark:bg-slate-800 shrink-0\\\">\\n          {(\\n            [\\n              { id: \'tema\', label: \'Tema\' },\\n              { id: \'area\', label: \'Grande \303\201rea\' },\\n              { id: \'geral\', label: \'Geral\' },\\n            ] as const\\n          ).map((item) => (\\n            <button\\n              key={item.id}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setScope(item.id)}\\n              className={cn(\\n                \'rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\',\\n                scope === item.id\\n                  ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-sm dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-white\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n              )}\\n            >\\n              {item.label}\\n            </button>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Simple unified progress bar with Community Median marker */}\\n      <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-xs\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n            Sua taxa de acerto:{\' \'}\\n            <strong className=\\\"font-mono text-sm font-bold tabular-nums text-slate-900 dark:text-white\\\">\\n              {current.studentPct.toFixed(1)}%\\n            </strong>\\n          </span>\\n\\n          <span\\n            className={cn(\\n              \'inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap\',\\n              isAbove && \'text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\',\\n              isBelow && \'text-red-700 dark:text-red-400\',\\n              !isAbove && !isBelow && \'text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\'\\n            )}\\n          >\\n            {isAbove && <TrendingUp className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />}\\n            {isBelow && <TrendingDown className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />}\\n            {!isAbove && !isBelow && <Minus className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />}\\n            <span className=\\\"font-mono\\\">{formatDelta(current.delta)}</span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span>{current.status}</span>\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Progress track + Median P50 benchmark pin */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative pt-1 pb-1\\\">\\n          <div\\n            role=\\\"progressbar\\\"\\n            aria-valuenow={Math.round(clampedStudent)}\\n            aria-valuemin={0}\\n            aria-valuemax={100}\\n            aria-label={`Sua taxa de acerto em ${current.label}: ${current.studentPct.toFixed(1)}%, mediana da comunidade: ${current.communityMedianPct.toFixed(1)}%`}\\n            className=\\\"relative h-3 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div\\n              className={cn(\\n                \'h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\',\\n                isAbove && \'bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-emerald-500\',\\n                isBelow && \'bg-red-500 dark:bg-red-500\',\\n                !isAbove && !isBelow && \'bg-sky-600 dark:bg-sky-400\'\\n              )}\\n              style={{ width: `${Math.max(clampedStudent, 2)}%` }}\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Community Median vertical indicator line */}\\n          <div\\n            className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-slate-900 dark:bg-white\\\"\\n            style={{ left: `${clampedMedian}%` }}\\n            title={`Mediana da Comunidade (P50): ${current.communityMedianPct.toFixed(1)}%`}\\n          />\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Scale legend row */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 tabular-nums\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <span\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \'inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full\',\\n                  isAbove && \'bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-emerald-500\',\\n                  isBelow && \'bg-red-500\',\\n                  !isAbove && !isBelow && \'bg-sky-600 dark:bg-sky-400\'\\n                )}\\n              />\\n              <span>Voc\303\252 ({current.studentPct.toFixed(1)}%)</span>\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"inline-block h-2.5 w-0.5 bg-slate-900 dark:bg-white\\\" />\\n              <span>\\n                Mediana P50 ({current.communityMedianPct.toFixed(1)}%)\\n              </span>\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n          <span className=\\\"font-mono\\\">0% \342\200\224 100%</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create StudentVsMedianBar component displaying an immediate progress indicator comparing student accuracy vs community median after answering a question\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/questions/StudentVsMedianBar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating StudentVsMedianBar component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create StudentVsMedianBar component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\317!\n\314!\001i\024}\023E2\255\204f\222\324M\037\177\361*\2737q\367\333\371\341\004\200\364U\254n\277$<\206\305\365\324jF\376dgc\231\326\224;&\000r\005\271[\221\273\205EB\340\333\370\236\005\224\222\234\332\371\223\031\226\343\261\271J\322\'g\331-\372\023d)\312!\242C\360YW\335#]\253\017\024:\b\177RS\245\334\270y\366\020\223\226\020d\346\nI!9\212+\322\332\005\246\347@\256\353\243%?\213\356F\222\347\361\216U\353\345\333\365\216<\251\322rb$j\f\343\240#\214\233J\\\325\203vm{\2232\322\322_\321m\347\355\277,\'h7G\"\245i\366T\343\t\211\321\377\2015d9\367\315\030qu\2629\244\034\273\244\311\212o\240\364\3115.\253\233\343RY1\302\320\274\371\240\204~\350\203\006iy\204,<\326\326\257\316gHv\250\023\035\357\330\330qS\363%]\275\343\005\356\376|\330\342_\330\366|\371\\CB.m)Uz\032YA\202\016\"\342\350\002\240\230\353\245E\327*#\376r\354\272(\277?P\363\034\340\241\027\345\037\354\365\270\271\304\347\201\376\260\252\2238\202z\330\345\304\251\340R\240k\2210o+\351\342\003\223\302\234p\323\'h\207\243\354@ICF\311\344\334\272\t\357\222HK\'\362Ec\212\243n\006\221\322\276.\260&\363\270\026\231[\003eU\375\322\216\343w\217\243\273_\2165aG3\035%\342u,Mr\301O\021<\344~G\000K\357\225\244!\316\206\'a\005\317\227)7Y\222\275\312\2114\214A\034\230|\022\027t^\222\027ic\204\235QX\273@\256\325\237T\351(}\267n\001fY\360\213\216\312\372s\245\022\337O\226R\243\347\313H(BD\303\230!l\377#\a\036{9\032\351\031\305\315\003}4f3yz\264\234\310mL\020\275\016B\202\236:\255:`B\347l%\'\030\215\240\316X\220\177\333Y\0303\344\237ZT\250\227\320\272\211\227\017\031S\233\b\275=1a/\223:\205\na\006\004\366@i\304!a\bT\267\351\352\337?\251\036\265E\300\316\314H\216\255\234\016\200R\303\307QD`4\246mD\035\032\346C5\357\270B\354^\v\206\207\021\017G\304\234?8\260\314\037\205\214\272\263t\317A\003\n\231\263\357t\274+0\332\231l\301^\215\247\026\f\332\264\261\362\032\371\203\341g\022\350\221_X\377\b\321\376\227\276\231!\333\212J\206\267g\027\034\366\313\2617\003(Z\003r\251\006\211+\213\231\'\242\2177*\