  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Type Definitions**\n\nI\'m currently working on defining the data structures. I\'m adding the `Flashcard`, `FlashcardSource`, and `SrsRating` interfaces to the `medical.ts` file. After that, I\'ll update the hook to handle flashcards and related settings.\n\n\n**Implementing Flashcard Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating auto-creation for incorrect answers and exposing various functions: `createFlashcardFromQuestion`, `generateFlashcardsFromErrors`, `reviewFlashcard`, `createCustomFlashcard`, `deleteFlashcard`, `hasFlashcardForQuestion`, and `dueFlashcardsCount`. I\'m also planning the `/src/components/flashcards/FlashcardsView.tsx` component, focusing on a clean SRS review experience with filter tabs, a live review queue, and intuitive card interaction, including keyboard shortcuts and SRS rating buttons with dynamic SM-2 interval previews.\n\n\n"
