  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Flashcards Feature**\n\nI\'m currently focused on integrating the \"Flashcards\" feature into the application layout. Specifically, I\'m working on adding a navigation item for it within `/src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx`. I\'ll incorporate the `Layers` icon and a live counter, `dueFlashcardsCount`, that will highlight when there are outstanding flashcards.\n\n\n**Adding Flashcard Functionality**\n\nI\'m now implementing the detailed flashcard creation features. I\'ve focused on adding a breadcrumb for flashcards. I\'m also adding a button in `/src/components/questions/QuestionCard.tsx` to transform a \"P\303\251rola\" into a flashcard, along with visual feedback. Then, I am going to include bulk and per-question creation buttons to `/src/components/notebook/ErrorNotebookView.tsx`, with a toggle for automatic flashcard generation on errors! Finally, I must connect it all in `/src/App.tsx`.\n\n\n"
