  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Application Built**: **MedR1 \342\200\224 Banco de Quest\303\265es para Resid\303\252ncia M\303\251dica (Brasil)**, a React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS v4 + Recharts EdTech web app competing with Estrat\303\251gia MED / Medway / MedCof / MedQ.\n- **Completed Prior User Turns**:\n  1. Initial full build: PostgreSQL/Supabase schema (`/database/schema.sql` with `percentile_cont(0.5)`/`0.75` views & indexes) + Prisma schema (`/database/schema.prisma`), 14 realistic Brazilian Medical Residency questions across all 5 Grandes \303\201reas (`USP-SP`, `UNICAMP`, `UNIFESP`, `ENARE`, `SUS-SP`, `PSU-MG`, `AMRIGS`, `UEPA`, `Revalida`), 3 generated clinical images (ECG, Chest X-ray, Head CT) with PACS zoom lightbox, Study & Simulado modes, alternative-by-alternative community distribution bars, Student vs. Community Median & P75 Performance Dashboard, Live Top 10+ Ranking with Pseudonym mode, Error Notebook (`Caderno de Erros`), Focus Mode, and Dark Mode.\n  2. Added immediate post-answer `StudentVsMedianBar` progress comparison inside `QuestionCard` in Study Mode.\n  3. Implemented complete SRS Flashcards system persisted in `localStorage` integrated with Clinical Pearls and `Caderno de Erros`.\n  4. Upgraded SRS algorithm in `src/lib/srs.ts` from SM-2 to **FSRS-4.5** with target retention selector (`85%`, `90%`, `95%`, default `0.90`), full state parameters (`stability`, `difficulty`, `elapsed_days`, `scheduled_days`, `reps`, `lapses`, `state`), and automatic migration of legacy SM-2 `localStorage` cards.\n- **Current Active User Request (Turn 5)**:\n  - *\"Adicione um campo de busca textual no FilterPanel que filtre as quest\303\265es pelo nome espec\303\255fico da prova (ex: \'ENARE 2023\', \'USP 2022\') al\303\251m dos filtros hier\303\241rquicos j\303\241 existentes.\"*\n  - All code edits for Turn 5 are **already written**, and ONLY final build/lint verification (`compile_applet` + `lint_applet`) and the concise Portuguese response to the user remain.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed in Previous Turns (Verified Passing `compile_applet` + `lint_applet`)\n- **Database Deliverables**: `/database/schema.sql`, `/database/schema.prisma`\n- **Generated Clinical Images**:\n  - `/src/assets/images/clinical_ecg_stemi_1795302152424.jpg`\n  - `/src/assets/images/clinical_xray_pneumothorax_1795302149327.jpg`\n  - `/src/assets/images/clinical_ct_epidural_1795302150711.jpg`\n- **Core App Files**: `/metadata.json`, `/index.html`, `/src/index.css`, `/src/lib/utils.ts`, `/src/lib/srs.ts`, `/src/types/medical.ts`, `/src/data/taxonomy.ts`, `/src/data/questions.ts`, `/src/data/analyticsSeed.ts`, `/src/data/rankingSeed.ts`, `/src/data/flashcardsSeed.ts`, `/src/hooks/useMedR1Store.ts`, `/src/components/ui/{Button,Select,Switch}.tsx`, `/src/components/layout/{Sidebar,TopBar}.tsx`, `/src/components/questions/{ClinicalImageViewer,FilterPanel,QuestionCard,SimuladoBar,StudentVsMedianBar}.tsx`, `/src/components/analytics/PerformanceDashboard.tsx`, `/src/components/ranking/{LiveRankingWidget,LiveRankingPage}.tsx`, `/src/components/notebook/ErrorNotebookView.tsx`, `/src/components/flashcards/FlashcardsView.tsx`, `/src/App.tsx`.\n- **Skills Read in Session**:\n  - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/6_education_simulations.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/shadcn/SKILL.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/cloudsql-setup/SKILL.md`\n\n### Completed Code Edits in Current Turn (NOT YET VERIFIED by `compile_applet` / `lint_applet`)\n1. `/src/types/medical.ts`: Added `examSearch: string` to `QuestionFilters` interface.\n2. `/src/hooks/useMedR1Store.ts`:\n   - Added `examSearch: \'\'` to `DEFAULT_FILTERS`.\n   - Updated `filterQuestions` to tokenize `filters.examSearch` (normalized, accent-stripped, split on spaces/slashes/hyphens) and require every token to match against the normalized exam identity string (`instituicao`, `instituicao` without hyphens, `ano`, `banca`, `tipoProva`, `estado`, `code`). For example, `\"USP 2025\"` matches `\"USP-SP 2025\"`, and `\"ENARE 2023\"` matches `\"ENARE 2023\"`.\n3. `/src/components/questions/FilterPanel.tsx`:\n   - Imported `FileSearch` from `lucide-react`.\n   - Added `examSuggestions` memoized list of unique `\"${instituicao} ${ano}\"` values sorted newest-first, attached via native `<datalist id=\"medr1-exam-suggestions\">`.\n   - Included `filters.examSearch.trim()` in `activeFilterCount`.\n   - Placed the new `\"Prova espec\303\255fica (ex.: ENARE 2025, USP 2025, SUS-SP 2024)...\"` search input alongside the existing keyword search bar in a responsive `grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12` row (`md:col-span-7` for keyword search, `md:col-span-5` for specific exam search).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Tailwind CSS v4 Dark Mode**: `/src/index.css` declares `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));` right below `@import \"tailwindcss\";` so toggling `.dark` on `<html>` works properly.\n- **No Cloud SQL Provisioning**: The original prompt explicitly requested realistic mocked data for immediate demonstration alongside SQL/Prisma schema deliverables, so client-side state with `localStorage` persistence is used throughout.\n- **Dataset Note for Specific Exams**: Note that `ENARE 2023` (`q-enare-2023-anulada-18`) has `anulada: true` and `USP-SP 2021` (`q-usp-2021-desatualizada-17`) has `desatualizada: true`, while `DEFAULT_FILTERS.excluirAnuladasDesatualizadas` defaults to `true`. All active 2023\342\200\2232025 exams (`USP-SP 2025`, `UNICAMP 2025`, `UNIFESP 2025`, `ENARE 2025`, `SUS-SP 2025`, `Revalida 2025`, `ENARE 2024`, `UNIFESP 2024`, `SUS-SP 2024`, `PSU-MG 2024`, `AMRIGS 2024`, `UEPA 2024`, `PSU-MG 2023`) are visible by default.\n- **Dependencies Installed**: `recharts`, `clsx`, `tailwind-merge` (in addition to starter `lucide-react`, `motion`, `react`, `tailwindcss`).\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Turn 1 Lint Error (Resolved)**: `tsc --noEmit` flagged 3 Recharts `Tooltip` `formatter={(val: number) => ...}` callbacks in `/src/components/analytics/PerformanceDashboard.tsx` because Recharts v3 types `val` as `ValueType | undefined`. Fixed by narrowing with `typeof val === \'number\' ? ... : ...`.\n- **No unresolved errors**; Turn 5 edits have not yet been compiled/linted.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Workspace is clean and ready for final Turn 5 verification.\n- All references to `DEFAULT_FILTERS` (in `App.tsx` and `FilterPanel.tsx`) automatically pick up `examSearch: \'\'` because they spread or reuse `DEFAULT_FILTERS`.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Run final verification**: Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in parallel to verify that the `examSearch` changes in `src/types/medical.ts`, `src/hooks/useMedR1Store.ts`, and `src/components/questions/FilterPanel.tsx` compile and pass `tsc --noEmit` with zero errors.\n2. If any TypeScript or build errors occur (unlikely, e.g., any place constructing `QuestionFilters` manually without `DEFAULT_FILTERS`), fix them surgically and re-run `compile_applet` + `lint_applet`.\n3. Provide a concise Portuguese summary to the user explaining the new specific-exam search field in `FilterPanel` (multi-token matching for institui\303\247\303\243o + ano + banca/tipo de prova, autocomplete suggestions via `<datalist>`, integration with active filter count and reset).\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Language**: Respond in Brazilian Portuguese (`pt-BR`), matching the user\'s language.\n- **Design Constitution**: Maintain zero static pill boxes on metadata, no thick left accent borders (`border-l-4`), single-elevation hairline borders, tabular numerals (`tabular-nums`), accessible focus rings, and full Light/Dark mode parity.\n- **Communication Style**: Concise, scannable completion summary without hype or raw internal file paths.\n- **Verification**: Always co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together on the final build check before concluding the turn.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 111
    render_latest_checkpoint: true
    total_subagent_count: 0
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Here is the full initial file tree for the application:\n/.env.example\n/.gitignore\n/index.html\n/metadata.json\n/package.json\n/src/App.tsx\n/src/index.css\n/src/main.tsx\n/tsconfig.json\n/vite.config.ts\n\nThe following dependencies are installed:\n@google/genai: ^2.4.0\n@tailwindcss/vite: ^4.3.3\n@vitejs/plugin-react: ^6.1.1\ndotenv: ^17.2.3\nexpress: ^4.21.2\nlucide-react: ^0.546.0\nmotion: ^12.23.24\nreact: ^19.0.1\nreact-dom: ^19.0.1\nvite: ^8.3.0\n\nThe following devDependencies are installed:\n@types/express: ^4.17.21\n@types/node: ^22.14.0\n@types/react: ^19.3.0\n@types/react-dom: ^19.3.0\nautoprefixer: ^10.4.21\nesbuild: ^0.25.0\ntailwindcss: ^4.3.3\ntsx: ^4.21.0\ntypescript: ^7.0.2\n\nKey file contents:\n\n--- /.env.example ---\n```\n# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.\n# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\n\n# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.\n# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.\nAPP_URL=\"MY_APP_URL\"\n\n```\n\n--- /index.html ---\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>My Google AI Studio App</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"My Google AI Studio App\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n\n```\n\n--- /metadata.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": [],\n  \"majorCapabilities\": [\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/App.tsx ---\n```typescript\n/**\n * @license\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n */\n\nexport default function App() {\n  return <div></div>;\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/index.css ---\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n```\n\n--- /src/main.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport {createRoot} from \'react-dom/client\';\nimport App from \'./App.tsx\';\nimport \'./index.css\';\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\'root\')!).render(<App />);\n\n```\n\n--- /tsconfig.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"types\": [\"vite/client\"],\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"ES2022\",\n      \"DOM\",\n      \"DOM.Iterable\"\n    ],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\n        \"./*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"dist\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /vite.config.ts ---\n```typescript\nimport tailwindcss from \'@tailwindcss/vite\';\nimport react from \'@vitejs/plugin-react\';\nimport fs from \'fs\';\nimport path from \'path\';\nimport {defineConfig} from \'vite\';\n\nexport default defineConfig(() => {\n  return {\n    plugins: [\n      react(),\n      tailwindcss(),\n      // Copies src/assets into dist/ so root-relative URLs like\n      // \"/src/assets/images/...\" (e.g. generate_image output) still resolve\n      // in production builds. Do not remove.\n      {\n        name: \'copy-unbundled-src-assets\',\n        apply: \'build\',\n        closeBundle(error?: Error): void {\n          if (error) {\n            return;\n          }\n          const distDir = path.resolve(__dirname, \'dist\');\n          const srcAssets = path.resolve(__dirname, \'src/assets\');\n          const distAssets = path.resolve(distDir, \'src/assets\');\n          if (fs.existsSync(distDir) && fs.existsSync(srcAssets)) {\n            fs.cpSync(srcAssets, distAssets, {recursive: true, force: true});\n          }\n        },\n      },\n    ],\n    resolve: {\n      alias: {\n        \'@\': path.resolve(__dirname, \'.\'),\n      },\n    },\n    server: {\n      // HMR is disabled in AI Studio via DISABLE_HMR env var.\n      // Do not modify\342\200\224file watching is disabled to prevent flickering during agent edits.\n      hmr: process.env.DISABLE_HMR !== \'true\',\n      // Disable file watching when DISABLE_HMR is true to save CPU during agent edits.\n      watch: process.env.DISABLE_HMR === \'true\' ? null : {},\n    },\n  };\n});\n\n```"
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "# Papel e Objetivo\nAtue como um Arquiteto de Software S\303\252nior, Especialista em EdTech M\303\251dica e Product Designer (UI/UX). Projete e desenvolva uma aplica\303\247\303\243o web completa, moderna e de alta performance de um **Banco de Quest\303\265es para Resid\303\252ncia M\303\251dica no Brasil**, projetado para competir diretamente com os l\303\255deres de mercado (Estrat\303\251gia MED, Medway, MedCof e MedQ).\n\n# 1. Stack Tecnol\303\263gica Sugerida\n- **Frontend:** React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS + Shadcn/UI (para uma interface limpa, minimalista, responsiva e com suporte a Dark Mode).\n- **Visualiza\303\247\303\243o de Dados:** Recharts ou Tremor (para gr\303\241ficos estat\303\255sticos limpos, responsivos e interativos).\n- **Backend & Banco de Dados:** Supabase (PostgreSQL para dados relacionais e estat\303\255sticas agregadas + Supabase Realtime/Presence para o ranking de usu\303\241rios online em tempo real + Supabase Auth).\n\n# 2. Arquitetura de Dados e Taxonomia M\303\251dica (Classifica\303\247\303\243o)\nModele o banco de dados relacional para suportar a hierarquia rigorosa das provas de resid\303\252ncia m\303\251dica brasileiras (ENARE/ENAMED, USP, UNICAMP, UNIFESP, SUS-SP, AMRIGS, PSU-MG, UEPA, Revalida, etc.):\n- **Estrutura Hier\303\241rquica de Classifica\303\247\303\243o:**\n  1. **Grande \303\201rea (5 pilares):** Cl\303\255nica M\303\251dica, Cirurgia Geral, Ginecologia e Obstetr\303\255cia (GO), Pediatria, Medicina Preventiva e Social (Sa\303\272de Coletiva).\n  2. **Especialidade / Tema:** Ex.: Cardiologia, Trauma, Pr\303\251-Natal, Neonatologia, Epidemiologia.\n  3. **Subtema / Foco:** Ex.: S\303\255ndrome Coronariana Aguda com Supra de ST, Atendimento Inicial ao Politraumatizado (ATLS), Diabetes Mellitus Gestacional.\n- **Metadados da Quest\303\243o:**\n  - `id`, `enunciado` (com suporte a imagens cl\303\255nicas, ECGs, radiografias com zoom e tabelas laboratoriais), `alternativas` (A, B, C, D e opcional E), `gabarito_oficial`, `anulada` (booleano), `desatualizada` (booleano), `banca`, `instituicao`, `ano`, `tipo_prova` (Acesso Direto, R+, Revalida), `nivel_dificuldade` (F\303\241cil, M\303\251dio, Dif\303\255cil - calculado dinamicamente pela taxa de acerto).\n  - **Coment\303\241rio Did\303\241tico Estruturado:** Explica\303\247\303\243o detalhada alternativa por alternativa (justificando a correta e apontando o erro de cada distrator) + \"P\303\251rola Cl\303\255nica / Ponto-Chave\" e refer\303\252ncia bibliogr\303\241fica (ex.: Harrison, Sabiston, Williams, Tratado de Pediatria SBP, Diretrizes Brasileiras).\n\n# 3. Motor de Busca, Filtros e Cria\303\247\303\243o de Listas/Simulados\nCrie um painel de filtros combin\303\241veis em tempo real com contador din\303\242mico de quest\303\265es dispon\303\255veis:\n- Busca textual por palavra-chave no enunciado ou coment\303\241rio.\n- Filtros encadeados: Grande \303\201rea -> Tema -> Subtema.\n- Filtros por Banca, Institui\303\247\303\243o, Estado/Regi\303\243o, Ano e N\303\255vel de Dificuldade.\n- Filtros de Status do Aluno: \"N\303\243o resolvidas\", \"Erradas por mim\", \"Acertadas\", \"Favoritadas/Caderno de Erros\", \"Com imagens\", \"Excluir anuladas/desatualizadas\".\n- **Modos de Resolu\303\247\303\243o:**\n  - *Modo Estudo:* Feedback imediato ap\303\263s marcar a alternativa, liberando estat\303\255sticas da comunidade e coment\303\241rio.\n  - *Modo Simulado / Prova na \303\215ntegra:* Cron\303\264metro regressivo, bloqueio de coment\303\241rios at\303\251 a entrega, op\303\247\303\243o de riscar/eliminar alternativas (strikethrough) e marcar d\303\272vida para revis\303\243o antes de finalizar.\n\n# 4. Cruzamento de Dados e Estat\303\255sticas por Quest\303\243o\nImediatamente ap\303\263s o aluno responder a uma quest\303\243o no Modo Estudo (ou ao revisar o Simulado), exiba um bloco anal\303\255tico limpo contendo:\n- **Taxa Global de Acertos:** Porcentagem exata de alunos da plataforma que acertaram aquela quest\303\243o.\n- **Distribui\303\247\303\243o por Alternativa:** Barras horizontais elegantes ao lado de cada alternativa (A, B, C, D, E) mostrando a porcentagem de usu\303\241rios que marcaram cada op\303\247\303\243o, destacando visualmente o gabarito oficial (verde), a escolha do usu\303\241rio (se errou, em vermelho) e o \"Principal Distrator\" (a alternativa incorreta mais marcada).\n\n# 5. Dashboard de Desempenho: Aluno vs. Comunidade (Mediana)\nDesenvolva uma aba dedicada de **M\303\251tricas e Intelig\303\252ncia de Desempenho** com foco na compara\303\247\303\243o entre o usu\303\241rio e a comunidade:\n- **Gr\303\241fico Principal (Comparativo de Mediana):** Gr\303\241fico de barras agrupadas ou radar/linha comparando o **Percentual de Acertos do Aluno** versus a **Mediana da Comunidade** (e o percentil 75 / \"Top Performers\") segmentado por:\n  - Vis\303\243o Geral;\n  - Cada uma das 5 Grandes \303\201reas;\n  - Temas espec\303\255ficos selecionados pelo usu\303\241rio.\n- **Tabela Anal\303\255tica Detalhada:** Tabela orden\303\241vel exibindo: `Grande \303\201rea / Tema`, `Quest\303\265es Feitas`, `Acertos do Aluno (%)`, `Mediana da Comunidade (%)`, `Diferen\303\247a (Delta +/- %)` e `Status` (Acima da Mediana, Na Mediana, Ponto de Aten\303\247\303\243o).\n- **Evolu\303\247\303\243o Temporal:** Gr\303\241fico de linha mostrando a curva de aprendizado semanal/mensal do aluno frente \303\240 linha de base da mediana da comunidade.\n\n# 6. Ranking Ao Vivo (Top 10+ Online) com Privacidade\nImplemente um widget/painel lateral e uma p\303\241gina dedicada para o **Ranking em Tempo Real**:\n- **Crit\303\251rios do Ranking:** Exibir pelo menos os **Top 10 usu\303\241rios online estudando no momento** (com indicador visual pulsante de status \"Online agora\"), ordenados por pontua\303\247\303\243o ponderada (combinando volume de quest\303\265es resolvidas na sess\303\243o/dia e taxa de acertos para evitar chutes aleat\303\263rios).\n- **Controle de Privacidade e Identidade (Pseud\303\264nimo):**\n  - Nas configura\303\247\303\265es de perfil e diretamente por um bot\303\243o r\303\241pido no card do ranking, o aluno pode alternar entre exibir seu **Nome Real** (ex.: \"Dr. Jo\303\243o Silva\") ou ativar o **Modo Pseud\303\264nimo / An\303\264nimo**, permitindo digitar um apelido personalizado (ex.: \"FutureR1_Cardio\", \"PlantonistaNoturno\") ou gerar um codinome aleat\303\263rio.\n  - Destacar sempre a posi\303\247\303\243o atual do usu\303\241rio logado na tabela (mesmo que ele esteja fora do Top 10, exibindo sua posi\303\247\303\243o logo abaixo com um divisor).\n\n# 7. Diretrizes de Design (UI/UX)\n- **Interface Amig\303\241vel e Limpa:** Fundo neutro (cinza muito claro `#F8FAFC` no modo claro / ard\303\263sia escuro `#0F172A` no modo escuro), cart\303\265es brancos com bordas sutis, tipografia altamente leg\303\255vel para textos m\303\251dicos longos (ex.: *Inter* ou *Plus Jakarta Sans*, largura m\303\241xima de leitura de 75 caracteres no enunciado).\n- **Zero Polui\303\247\303\243o Visual:** Durante a resolu\303\247\303\243o da quest\303\243o, ocultar menus desnecess\303\241rios (\"Modo Foco\") para maximizar a reten\303\247\303\243o e simular o ambiente real de prova.\n- **Responsividade:** Totalmente funcional em desktop (ideal para simulados longos) e mobile (para resolver quest\303\265es r\303\241pidas nos intervalos).\n\n# Entreg\303\241veis Esperados\n1. Esquema completo do banco de dados (SQL/Prisma) com \303\255ndices otimizados para consultas estat\303\255sticas e c\303\241lculo de mediana (`percentile_cont(0.5)`).\n2. Estrutura de pastas e arquitetura do frontend.\n3. Implementa\303\247\303\243o funcional completa da tela de **Resolu\303\247\303\243o de Quest\303\265es** (com filtros, cruzamento de porcentagem por alternativa e coment\303\241rios), do **Dashboard de Desempenho (Aluno vs. Mediana)** e do **Widget de Ranking Online Top 10+ com seletor de Pseud\303\264nimo**, utilizando dados mockados realistas de quest\303\265es de resid\303\252ncia m\303\251dica brasileira para demonstra\303\247\303\243o imediata."
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Na visualiza\303\247\303\243o da quest\303\243o resolvida (ap\303\263s responder no Modo Estudo), adicione um componente visual que mostre o comparativo imediato da taxa de acerto do aluno versus a mediana da comunidade, usando um indicador de progresso simples."
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "\"Implemente um sistema completo de Flashcards com Repeti\303\247\303\243o Espa\303\247ada (SRS) no MedR1, persistido em localStorage, totalmente integrado \303\240s P\303\251rolas Cl\303\255nicas e ao Caderno de Erros:\n1. Crie uma nova aba/rota \'Flashcards\' na navega\303\247\303\243o principal com contador de cards vencidos para hoje e filtro por especialidade.\n2. No card de coment\303\241rio p\303\263s-resposta das quest\303\265es, adicione um bot\303\243o \'Transformar P\303\251rola em Flashcard\' (com feedback visual quando j\303\241 estiver salvo) e crie uma op\303\247\303\243o/automa\303\247\303\243o para gerar flashcards das quest\303\265es erradas no Caderno de Erros.\n3. Na tela de revis\303\243o de Flashcards, exiba a Frente (pergunta objetiva ou caso cl\303\255nico resumido), bot\303\243o/atalho Espa\303\247o para virar para o Verso (P\303\251rola Cl\303\255nica + link para abrir a quest\303\243o original) e 4 bot\303\265es de avalia\303\247\303\243o (1 - Errei: hoje, 2 - Dif\303\255cil: 1d, 3 - Bom: 3d, 4 - F\303\241cil: 5d) usando algoritmo de repeti\303\247\303\243o espa\303\247ada.\""
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Prompt para atualizar para FSRS:\n\"Substitua o algoritmo SM-2 atual em src/lib/srs.ts pelo algoritmo FSRS (Free Spaced Repetition Scheduler) com reten\303\247\303\243o alvo configurada em 90% (0.90):\n1. Implemente os par\303\242metros de estado do FSRS em cada flashcard: stability (S), difficulty (D), elapsed_days, scheduled_days, reps, lapses e state (New, Learning, Review, Relearning).\n2. Atualize os bot\303\265es de avalia\303\247\303\243o (1 - Errei, 2 - Dif\303\255cil, 3 - Bom, 4 - F\303\241cil) para calcular dinamicamente os pr\303\263ximos intervalos com base na curva de esquecimento do FSRS e exibir o tempo estimado exato em cada bot\303\243o (ex.: < 10m, 2d, 5d, 11d).\n3. Adicione um seletor discreto no topo da aba Flashcards permitindo ajustar a Reten\303\247\303\243o Desejada (85%, 90% ou 95%).\""
    }
