  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Flashcard UX**\n\nI\'m currently focused on polishing the user experience within `/src/components/flashcards/FlashcardsView.tsx`. Specifically, I\'m examining line 513, ensuring the component is visually appealing and accessible. I\'m prioritizing responsiveness and a clean, uncluttered design, free of any overflow issues.\n\n\n**Addressing Overflow Concerns**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed a potential issue with the `overflow-hidden` style in `/src/components/flashcards/FlashcardsView.tsx`, specifically around line 513. It could clip tooltips on mobile devices. I\'m considering removing it from the `<article>` element to ensure tooltips display correctly, or adding the rounded corners to child elements, such as the body and header, which should also solve the problem. Also, I\'m working on defining typed metadata for the four rating options.\n\n\n**Defining Rating Metadata**\n\nI\'ve completed defining the typed metadata for the rating options. Now, I\'m turning my attention to the `formatScheduled` helper function for the exact review date. I\'m focusing on ensuring it\'s efficient and readable, so the display logic is both understandable and performant.\n\n\n**Implementing FSRS Forecasts**\n\nI\'m now implementing the FSRS forecast display. I\'ve defined the logic for showing \"Hoje\" or a formatted date. I\'m focusing on two widgets: one subtle interactive widget before flipping the card, and a more compact one above the rating buttons after flipping. The before-flip widget will provide a tooltip with estimated intervals. After flipping, I\'ll display the hair-thin widget, highlighting the full forecast when a rating is hovered.\n\n\n**Designing Tooltips for Ratings**\n\nI\'m currently designing the floating tooltips for each rating button. My focus is on providing concise, informative feedback. Each tooltip will display the next review date and the FSRS stability. The tooltip will be triggered by hover or keyboard focus for accessibility, and provides a clear date (\"25/11\") and stability (\"S 3.7d\").\n\n\n"
    message_id: "rywCa8WEL6GVmtkP__q16QQ"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7013603481076415398"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add FSRS next-review forecast widget and hover/focus tooltips to FlashcardsView\", \"Instruction\":\"Import CalendarClock and computeAllFsrsOutcomes, add FSRS forecast widget and hover/focus tooltips before and during rating in FlashcardsView.tsx\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":28, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  Clock,\\n  CalendarClock,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  BookOpen,\\n  X,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type {\\n  Flashcard,\\n  FsrsState,\\n  GrandeAreaId,\\n  SrsRating,\\n  TargetRetention,\\n} from \'../../types/medical\';\\nimport { GRANDES_AREAS } from \'../../data/taxonomy\';\\nimport {\\n  computeAllFsrsOutcomes,\\n  formatFsrsInterval,\\n  getCardCurrentRetrievabilityPct,\\n  isCardDueToday,\\n  type FsrsScheduleOutcome,\\n} from \'../../lib/srs\';\", \"StartLine\":9, \"TargetContent\":\"  Clock,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  BookOpen,\\n  X,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type {\\n  Flashcard,\\n  FsrsState,\\n  GrandeAreaId,\\n  SrsRating,\\n  TargetRetention,\\n} from \'../../types/medical\';\\nimport { GRANDES_AREAS } from \'../../data/taxonomy\';\\nimport {\\n  formatFsrsInterval,\\n  getCardCurrentRetrievabilityPct,\\n  getFsrsRatingPreviews,\\n  isCardDueToday,\\n} from \'../../lib/srs\';\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":63, \"ReplacementContent\":\"const FSRS_STATE_LABEL: Record<FsrsState, string> = {\\n  New: \'Novo\',\\n  Learning: \'Aprendendo\',\\n  Review: \'Revis\303\243o\',\\n  Relearning: \'Reaprendendo\',\\n};\\n\\nconst RATING_CONFIG: Array<{\\n  rating: SrsRating;\\n  keyHint: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  dotClass: string;\\n  textClass: string;\\n  subTextClass: string;\\n  buttonClass: string;\\n}> = [\\n  {\\n    rating: 1,\\n    keyHint: \'1\',\\n    label: \'Errei\',\\n    dotClass: \'bg-red-500\',\\n    textClass: \'text-red-700 dark:text-red-400\',\\n    subTextClass: \'text-red-600/85 dark:text-red-300/85\',\\n    buttonClass:\\n      \'border-red-200 bg-red-50/70 hover:bg-red-100/80 dark:border-red-900/60 dark:bg-red-950/30 dark:hover:bg-red-950/60 focus-visible:ring-red-500\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    rating: 2,\\n    keyHint: \'2\',\\n    label: \'Dif\303\255cil\',\\n    dotClass: \'bg-amber-500\',\\n    textClass: \'text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-400\',\\n    subTextClass: \'text-amber-700/85 dark:text-amber-300/85\',\\n    buttonClass:\\n      \'border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/70 hover:bg-amber-100/80 dark:border-amber-900/60 dark:bg-amber-950/30 dark:hover:bg-amber-950/60 focus-visible:ring-amber-500\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    rating: 3,\\n    keyHint: \'3\',\\n    label: \'Bom\',\\n    dotClass: \'bg-sky-500\',\\n    textClass: \'text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-300\',\\n    subTextClass: \'text-sky-700/85 dark:text-sky-300/85\',\\n    buttonClass:\\n      \'border-sky-200 bg-sky-50/70 hover:bg-sky-100/80 dark:border-sky-900/60 dark:bg-sky-950/30 dark:hover:bg-sky-950/60 focus-visible:ring-sky-500\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    rating: 4,\\n    keyHint: \'4\',\\n    label: \'F\303\241cil\',\\n    dotClass: \'bg-emerald-500\',\\n    textClass: \'text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-400\',\\n    subTextClass: \'text-emerald-700/85 dark:text-emerald-300/85\',\\n    buttonClass:\\n      \'border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/70 hover:bg-emerald-100/80 dark:border-emerald-900/60 dark:bg-emerald-950/30 dark:hover:bg-emerald-950/60 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nfunction formatOutcomeDate(outcome: FsrsScheduleOutcome): string {\\n  if (outcome.scheduled_days === 0) return \'Hoje\';\\n  return new Date(outcome.dueAt).toLocaleDateString(\'pt-BR\', {\\n    day: \'2-digit\',\\n    month: \'2-digit\',\\n  });\\n}\", \"StartLine\":57, \"TargetContent\":\"const FSRS_STATE_LABEL: Record<FsrsState, string> = {\\n  New: \'Novo\',\\n  Learning: \'Aprendendo\',\\n  Review: \'Revis\303\243o\',\\n  Relearning: \'Reaprendendo\',\\n};\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":83, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const [flipped, setFlipped] = useState(false);\\n  const [hoveredRating, setHoveredRating] = useState<SrsRating | null>(null);\\n  const [sessionIndex, setSessionIndex] = useState(0);\\n  const [showCreateForm, setShowCreateForm] = useState(false);\", \"StartLine\":79, \"TargetContent\":\"  const [flipped, setFlipped] = useState(false);\\n  const [sessionIndex, setSessionIndex] = useState(0);\\n  const [showCreateForm, setShowCreateForm] = useState(false);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":140, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  // Reset flip & clamp index when queue changes\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    setFlipped(false);\\n    setHoveredRating(null);\\n    if (sessionIndex >= dueQueue.length) {\\n      setSessionIndex(0);\\n    }\\n  }, [dueQueue.length, selectedArea, selectedTema, practiceAhead, sessionIndex]);\\n\\n  const activeCard = dueQueue[sessionIndex] ?? dueQueue[0];\\n\\n  const handleRate = useCallback(\\n    (rating: SrsRating) => {\\n      if (!activeCard) return;\\n      onReviewCard(activeCard.id, rating);\\n      setFlipped(false);\\n      setHoveredRating(null);\", \"StartLine\":122, \"TargetContent\":\"  // Reset flip & clamp index when queue changes\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    setFlipped(false);\\n    if (sessionIndex >= dueQueue.length) {\\n      setSessionIndex(0);\\n    }\\n  }, [dueQueue.length, selectedArea, selectedTema, practiceAhead, sessionIndex]);\\n\\n  const activeCard = dueQueue[sessionIndex] ?? dueQueue[0];\\n\\n  const handleRate = useCallback(\\n    (rating: SrsRating) => {\\n      if (!activeCard) return;\\n      onReviewCard(activeCard.id, rating);\\n      setFlipped(false);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":221, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const fsrsOutcomes = useMemo(\\n    () => (activeCard ? computeAllFsrsOutcomes(activeCard, targetRetention) : null),\\n    [activeCard, targetRetention]\\n  );\\n\\n  const activeRetrievabilityPct = activeCard\\n    ? getCardCurrentRetrievabilityPct(activeCard)\\n    : null;\\n\\n  const hoveredOutcome =\\n    hoveredRating && fsrsOutcomes ? fsrsOutcomes[hoveredRating] : null;\\n  const hoveredConfig = hoveredRating\\n    ? RATING_CONFIG.find((c) => c.rating === hoveredRating) ?? null\\n    : null;\", \"StartLine\":213, \"TargetContent\":\"  const ratingPreviews = useMemo(\\n    () => (activeCard ? getFsrsRatingPreviews(activeCard, targetRetention) : null),\\n    [activeCard, targetRetention]\\n  );\\n\\n  const activeRetrievabilityPct = activeCard\\n    ? getCardCurrentRetrievabilityPct(activeCard)\\n    : null;\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":585, \"ReplacementContent\":\"          {activeCard ? (\\n            <article className=\\\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900\\\">\\n              {/* Card Metadata Header */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-200 px-5 py-3.5 sm:px-7 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-400\\\">\\n                    {activeCard.grandeArea}\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">/</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                    {activeCard.tema}\\n                  </span>\\n                  {activeCard.institutionLabel && (\\n                    <>\\n                      <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-mono\\\">{activeCard.institutionLabel}</span>\\n                    </>\\n                  )}\\n                  <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                    {FSRS_STATE_LABEL[activeCard.state]}\\n                  </span>\\n                  {activeCard.state !== \'New\' && (\\n                    <>\\n                      <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                        S {activeCard.stability.toFixed(1)}d \302\267 D{\' \'}\\n                        {activeCard.difficulty.toFixed(1)}\\n                        {activeRetrievabilityPct !== null\\n                          ? ` \302\267 R ${activeRetrievabilityPct}%`\\n                          : \'\'}\\n                      </span>\\n                    </>\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  {practiceAhead\\n                    ? `Pr\303\241tica livre \302\267 ${sessionIndex + 1}/${dueQueue.length}`\\n                    : `Restam ${dueQueue.length} hoje`}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Card Body: Front always visible, Back revealed on flip */}\\n              <div className=\\\"px-5 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:py-10 space-y-6\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5\\\">\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    Frente \342\200\224 Recorda\303\247\303\243o Ativa\\n                  </p>\\n                  <p className=\\\"max-w-[72ch] text-base sm:text-lg font-medium leading-[1.68] text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                    {activeCard.front}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {!flipped ? (\\n                  <div className=\\\"pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5\\\">\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                        Tente formular a conduta mentalmente antes de revelar o verso.\\n                      </p>\\n\\n                      {/* Pre-flip FSRS next-review forecast tooltip trigger */}\\n                      {fsrsOutcomes && (\\n                        <div className=\\\"relative group inline-flex\\\">\\n                          <button\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-400 dark:hover:text-sky-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-sky-500 rounded cursor-help\\\"\\n                            aria-describedby=\\\"pre-flip-fsrs-tooltip\\\"\\n                          >\\n                            <CalendarClock className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                            <span>Previs\303\243o FSRS</span>\\n                          </button>\\n\\n                          <div\\n                            id=\\\"pre-flip-fsrs-tooltip\\\"\\n                            role=\\\"tooltip\\\"\\n                            className=\\\"pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0 translate-y-1 group-hover:visible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-focus-within:visible group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-focus-within:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-150 absolute bottom-full left-0 z-30 mb-2 w-64 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-900 p-3 text-left text-xs text-slate-100 shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800\\\"\\n                          >\\n                            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-700/80 pb-1.5 mb-2\\\">\\n                              <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-white\\\">\\n                                Pr\303\263xima revis\303\243o estimada\\n                              </span>\\n                              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400 tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                Alvo {Math.round(targetRetention * 100)}%\\n                              </span>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <dl className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                              {RATING_CONFIG.map((cfg) => {\\n                                const outcome = fsrsOutcomes[cfg.rating];\\n                                return (\\n                                  <div\\n                                    key={cfg.rating}\\n                                    className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\\\"\\n                                  >\\n                                    <dt className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-300\\\">\\n                                      <span\\n                                        className={cn(\\n                                          \'h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full\',\\n                                          cfg.dotClass\\n                                        )}\\n                                      />\\n                                      <span>{cfg.label}</span>\\n                                    </dt>\\n                                    <dd className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums text-white\\\">\\n                                      {outcome.longPreviewLabel}\\n                                      <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">\\n                                        {\' \'}\\n                                        \302\267 {formatOutcomeDate(outcome)}\\n                                      </span>\\n                                    </dd>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                );\\n                              })}\\n                            </dl>\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                      )}\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <Button\\n                      variant=\\\"primary\\\"\\n                      size=\\\"lg\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setFlipped(true)}\\n                    >\\n                      <RotateCw className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n                      <span>Virar card</span>\\n                      <kbd className=\\\"ml-1 rounded bg-white/20 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] dark:bg-slate-950/20\\\">\\n                        Espa\303\247o\\n                      </kbd>\\n                    </Button>\\n                  </div>\\n                ) : (\", \"StartLine\":512, \"TargetContent\":\"          {activeCard ? (\\n            <article className=\\\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              {/* Card Metadata Header */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-200 px-5 py-3.5 sm:px-7 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-400\\\">\\n                    {activeCard.grandeArea}\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">/</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                    {activeCard.tema}\\n                  </span>\\n                  {activeCard.institutionLabel && (\\n                    <>\\n                      <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-mono\\\">{activeCard.institutionLabel}</span>\\n                    </>\\n                  )}\\n                  <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                    {FSRS_STATE_LABEL[activeCard.state]}\\n                  </span>\\n                  {activeCard.state !== \'New\' && (\\n                    <>\\n                      <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                        S {activeCard.stability.toFixed(1)}d \302\267 D{\' \'}\\n                        {activeCard.difficulty.toFixed(1)}\\n                        {activeRetrievabilityPct !== null\\n                          ? ` \302\267 R ${activeRetrievabilityPct}%`\\n                          : \'\'}\\n                      </span>\\n                    </>\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  {practiceAhead\\n                    ? `Pr\303\241tica livre \302\267 ${sessionIndex + 1}/${dueQueue.length}`\\n                    : `Restam ${dueQueue.length} hoje`}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Card Body: Front always visible, Back revealed on flip */}\\n              <div className=\\\"px-5 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:py-10 space-y-6\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5\\\">\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    Frente \342\200\224 Recorda\303\247\303\243o Ativa\\n                  </p>\\n                  <p className=\\\"max-w-[72ch] text-base sm:text-lg font-medium leading-[1.68] text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                    {activeCard.front}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {!flipped ? (\\n                  <div className=\\\"pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                      Tente formular a conduta mentalmente antes de revelar o verso.\\n                    </p>\\n                    <Button\\n                      variant=\\\"primary\\\"\\n                      size=\\\"lg\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setFlipped(true)}\\n                    >\\n                      <RotateCw className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n                      <span>Virar card</span>\\n                      <kbd className=\\\"ml-1 rounded bg-white/20 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] dark:bg-slate-950/20\\\">\\n                        Espa\303\247o\\n                      </kbd>\\n                    </Button>\\n                  </div>\\n                ) : (\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":686, \"ReplacementContent\":\"                    {/* 4 FSRS Rating Buttons + Live Next-Review Forecast Widget & Hover Tooltips */}\\n                    {fsrsOutcomes && (\\n                      <div className=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                          <span>\\n                            Como foi sua recorda\303\247\303\243o? (Atalhos: 1, 2, 3 ou 4)\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                            FSRS \302\267 Alvo {Math.round(targetRetention * 100)}%\\n                          </span>\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        {/* Interactive FSRS Decision Preview Widget */}\\n                        <div\\n                          aria-live=\\\"polite\\\"\\n                          className=\\\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 px-3.5 py-2.5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950/60\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          {hoveredOutcome && hoveredConfig ? (\\n                            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs\\\">\\n                              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0\\\">\\n                                <span\\n                                  className={cn(\\n                                    \'h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full\',\\n                                    hoveredConfig.dotClass\\n                                  )}\\n                                />\\n                                <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                                  {hoveredConfig.label}\\n                                </span>\\n                                <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                                  \342\206\222\\n                                </span>\\n                                <span className=\\\"text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                  {hoveredOutcome.scheduled_days === 0 &&\\n                                  hoveredOutcome.previewLabel === \'< 10m\' ? (\\n                                    <>\\n                                      Reaparece hoje em{\' \'}\\n                                      <strong className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\\\">\\n                                        {hoveredOutcome.longPreviewLabel}\\n                                      </strong>\\n                                    </>\\n                                  ) : (\\n                                    <>\\n                                      Pr\303\263xima revis\303\243o em{\' \'}\\n                                      <strong className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\\\">\\n                                        {hoveredOutcome.longPreviewLabel}\\n                                      </strong>{\' \'}\\n                                      <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                                        ({formatOutcomeDate(hoveredOutcome)})\\n                                      </span>\\n                                    </>\\n                                  )}\\n                                </span>\\n                              </div>\\n                              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                                Nova S {hoveredOutcome.stability.toFixed(1)}d \302\267 D{\' \'}\\n                                {hoveredOutcome.difficulty.toFixed(1)} \302\267{\' \'}\\n                                {FSRS_STATE_LABEL[hoveredOutcome.state]}\\n                              </span>\\n                            </div>\\n                          ) : (\\n                            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs\\\">\\n                              <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                                <CalendarClock className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                                <span>Previs\303\243o da pr\303\263xima revis\303\243o:</span>\\n                              </span>\\n                              <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                {RATING_CONFIG.map((cfg) => (\\n                                  <span\\n                                    key={cfg.rating}\\n                                    className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\\\"\\n                                  >\\n                                    <span\\n                                      className={cn(\\n                                        \'h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full\',\\n                                        cfg.dotClass\\n                                      )}\\n                                    />\\n                                    <span className=\\\"font-sans text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                                      {cfg.label}:\\n                                    </span>\\n                                    <strong className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                                      {fsrsOutcomes[cfg.rating].longPreviewLabel}\\n                                    </strong>\\n                                  </span>\\n                                ))}\\n                              </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                          )}\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2.5\\\">\\n                          {RATING_CONFIG.map((cfg) => {\\n                            const outcome = fsrsOutcomes[cfg.rating];\\n                            const dateLabel = formatOutcomeDate(outcome);\\n                            const tooltipId = `fsrs-rating-tip-${cfg.rating}`;\\n\\n                            return (\\n                              <div key={cfg.rating} className=\\\"relative group\\\">\\n                                {/* Hover / Focus Tooltip */}\\n                                <div\\n                                  id={tooltipId}\\n                                  role=\\\"tooltip\\\"\\n                                  className=\\\"pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0 translate-y-1 group-hover:visible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-focus-within:visible group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-focus-within:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-150 absolute bottom-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-30 mb-2 w-max max-w-[200px] rounded-lg border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-900 px-2.5 py-2 text-center shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800\\\"\\n                                >\\n                                  <p className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-white whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                    {outcome.scheduled_days === 0 &&\\n                                    outcome.previewLabel === \'< 10m\'\\n                                      ? `Hoje \302\267 ${outcome.longPreviewLabel}`\\n                                      : `Em ${outcome.longPreviewLabel} \302\267 ${dateLabel}`}\\n                                  </p>\\n                                  <p className=\\\"mt-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-300 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                    S {outcome.stability.toFixed(1)}d \302\267 D{\' \'}\\n                                    {outcome.difficulty.toFixed(1)}\\n                                  </p>\\n                                  <span\\n                                    aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                                    className=\\\"absolute top-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 border-4 border-transparent border-t-slate-900 dark:border-t-slate-800\\\"\\n                                  />\\n                                </div>\\n\\n                                <button\\n                                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                  aria-describedby={tooltipId}\\n                                  onMouseEnter={() => setHoveredRating(cfg.rating)}\\n                                  onMouseLeave={() =>\\n                                    setHoveredRating((cur) =>\\n                                      cur === cfg.rating ? null : cur\\n                                    )\\n                                  }\\n                                  onFocus={() => setHoveredRating(cfg.rating)}\\n                                  onBlur={() =>\\n                                    setHoveredRating((cur) =>\\n                                      cur === cfg.rating ? null : cur\\n                                    )\\n                                  }\\n                                  onClick={() => handleRate(cfg.rating)}\\n                                  className={cn(\\n                                    \'w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl border px-3 py-3 text-center transition-colors cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2\',\\n                                    cfg.buttonClass\\n                                  )}\\n                                >\\n                                  <span\\n                                    className={cn(\'text-xs font-bold\', cfg.textClass)}\\n                                  >\\n                                    {cfg.keyHint} \302\267 {cfg.label}\\n                                  </span>\\n                                  <span\\n                                    className={cn(\\n                                      \'font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums\',\\n                                      cfg.subTextClass\\n                                    )}\\n                                  >\\n                                    {outcome.longPreviewLabel}\\n                                  </span>\\n                                </button>\\n                              </div>\\n                            );\\n                          })}\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    )}\", \"StartLine\":618, \"TargetContent\":\"                    {/* 4 FSRS Rating Buttons */}\\n                    {ratingPreviews && (\\n                      <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                          <span>\\n                            Como foi sua recorda\303\247\303\243o? (Atalhos: 1, 2, 3 ou 4)\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                    