  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining The UI**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the UI\'s practical aspects, crafting a refined modal interface. This entails adhering to our design principles: a singular elevation, delicate hairline borders, and eschewing static pills. I\'m prioritizing responsiveness, clean focus indicators, and accessible close mechanisms with Escape key and backdrop click functionalities. The design will be implemented for a Light theme.\n\n\n**Analyzing Weight Persistence**\n\nI\'m now thoroughly examining the implementation details for persisting exam weights. I need to ensure that the logic for reading, saving, and updating weights across different boards (`UEPA`, `ENARE`, `GERAL`) is robust. The goal is complete parity with `localStorage` and clear mapping of weight tiers to percentage adjustments. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the `GERAL` board to ensure editable topics and clear individual topic adjustments.\n\n\n**Structuring Custom Weights**\n\nI\'m now refining the data structure for custom exam weights in `localStorage`, specifically the `\'medr1_custom_exam_weights\'` key. I\'m focusing on defining an `overrides` property using a `Record` keyed by the canonical default rule topic name and the `IncidenceTier`, ensuring `getBoardDelta` and `getExamTopicWeight` always reflect the merged weights. I\'m also ensuring the Geral tab in `ExamWeightsModal` is consistent with other board buttons. I\'m prioritizing the implementation of topic management features, including adding and removing custom topics, and restoring default weights.\n\n\n**Clarifying Override Logic**\n\nI\'m now recognizing the brilliance of separating `overrides` and `customTopics`. This structure immediately reveals user-edited built-in topics, enabling visual highlighting and accurate tracking. It facilitates clean removal of overrides upon resetting defaults and allows seamless management of custom topics, including individual deletion and full reset. It also makes matching the priority easier.\n\n\n**Prioritizing User Input**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the user\'s input, specifically custom-added topics. I must ensure these always take precedence, even over existing, broad default rules, for exact and partial matches. Next, I will check the board\'s rules, accounting for applied overrides. I\'m also considering reactivity; any changes to weights should instantly trigger recomputation of flashcard retention and FSRS intervals via reactive signals. I also need to update the Exam Weight version State.\n\n\n**Designing Live-Sync Persistence**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating `bumpExamWeightsVersion` and ensuring immediate data persistence. My plan is to include `weightsVersion` in `useMemo` dependencies within `FlashcardsView`, ensuring updates are reflected instantly. Ideally, changes within `ExamWeightsModal` will live-sync, or notify `onWeightsUpdated()`, so that closing the modal or clicking \"Concluir\" guarantees immediate display of updated retention badges and FSRS intervals. I\'m also planning a clean, responsive modal overlay design with a header and board tabs.\n\n\n**Constructing New Components**\n\nI\'m now building the components for better exam weight control. The plan includes a compact, responsive form for adding new topics, featuring a text input, tier selector, and submit button. I\'m also adding a search and weight filter bar with live counters and filter buttons. Finally, the topic list will have hairline-divided rows showing topic names, status indicators, and keyword hints for default topics.\n\n\n**Implementing Segmented Control**\n\nI\'m now implementing the 3-way segmented control for quick weight adjustments, including clear visual styling for each level and edited topic highlighting. I\'m focusing on user-friendly footer elements, including a \'Restore Defaults\' button and a summary with a \'Save and Apply\' button that triggers recalculation and closes the modal. I\'m also planning the integration of this within `/src/components/flashcards/FlashcardsView.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "jTACa9jrCIm7mtkPzu6-sAw"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14404828257980413214"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import type { ExamBoard } from \'../types/medical\';\\n\\nexport type IncidenceTier = \'alta\' | \'media\' | \'baixa\';\\n\\nexport interface BoardIncidenceRule {\\n  topic: string;\\n  tier: IncidenceTier;\\n  delta: number;\\n  keywords: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface BoardWeightResolution {\\n  board: ExamBoard;\\n  tier: IncidenceTier;\\n  delta: number;\\n  matchedTopic: string | null;\\n  reason: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CustomExamTopic {\\n  id: string;\\n  topic: string;\\n  tier: IncidenceTier;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CustomBoardWeights {\\n  overrides: Record<string, IncidenceTier>;\\n  customTopics: CustomExamTopic[];\\n}\\n\\nexport type StoredCustomExamWeights = Record<ExamBoard, CustomBoardWeights>;\\n\\nexport interface EffectiveBoardTopic {\\n  id: string;\\n  topic: string;\\n  tier: IncidenceTier;\\n  defaultTier?: IncidenceTier;\\n  delta: number;\\n  keywords: string[];\\n  isCustom: boolean;\\n  isEdited: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const STORAGE_KEY_CUSTOM_EXAM_WEIGHTS = \'medr1_custom_exam_weights\';\\n\\nexport const TIER_DELTA: Record<IncidenceTier, number> = {\\n  alta: 0.03,\\n  media: 0.0,\\n  baixa: -0.03,\\n};\\n\\nexport const EXAM_BOARD_LABELS: Record<ExamBoard, string> = {\\n  UEPA: \'UEPA\',\\n  ENARE: \'ENARE\',\\n  GERAL: \'Geral\',\\n};\\n\\n/**\\n * Normalizes Brazilian Portuguese medical strings for resilient partial matching\\n * (strips diacritics, lowercases, replaces separators with single spaces).\\n */\\nexport function normalizeMedicalText(value: string): string {\\n  return value\\n    .toLowerCase()\\n    .normalize(\'NFD\')\\n    .replace(/[\\\\u0300-\\\\u036f]/g, \'\')\\n    .replace(/[/\\\\-_,.;:()]+/g, \' \')\\n    .replace(/\\\\s+/g, \' \')\\n    .trim();\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Default incidence matrices calibrated to Brazilian medical residency exam blueprints.\\n * Priority within each board checks specific \\\"baixa\\\" subspecialties first when matching\\n * partial strings so niche topics (e.g., \\\"Oncologia Pedi\303\241trica\\\", \\\"Reumatologia Rara\\\")\\n * do not get misclassified under broad parent areas.\\n */\\nexport const BOARD_INCIDENCE_MATRIX: Record<ExamBoard, BoardIncidenceRule[]> = {\\n  UEPA: [\\n    // Baixa incid\303\252ncia (-0.03) \342\200\224 checked first for high-specificity subspecialties\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Reumatologia Rara\',\\n      tier: \'baixa\',\\n      delta: -0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'reumatologia rara\',\\n        \'esclerose sistemica\',\\n        \'dermatomiosite\',\\n        \'polimiosite\',\\n        \'sjogren\',\\n        \'vasculite rara\',\\n        \'doenca mista do tecido conjuntivo\',\\n        \'policondrite\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Subespecialidades Cir\303\272rgicas\',\\n      tier: \'baixa\',\\n      delta: -0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'subespecialidades cirurgicas\',\\n        \'cirurgia plastica\',\\n        \'cirurgia cardiaca\',\\n        \'cirurgia toracica eletiva\',\\n        \'neurocirurgia eletiva\',\\n        \'cirurgia de cabeca e pescoco\',\\n        \'microcirurgia\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Gen\303\251tica\',\\n      tier: \'baixa\',\\n      delta: -0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'genetica\',\\n        \'genetica medica\',\\n        \'cromossomopatia\',\\n        \'doenca genetica\',\\n        \'erro inato\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Oftalmologia / Otorrino\',\\n      tier: \'baixa\',\\n      delta: -0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'oftalmologia\',\\n        \'oftalmo\',\\n        \'otorrino\',\\n        \'otorrinolaringologia\',\\n        \'orl\',\\n        \'glaucoma\',\\n        \'catarata\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n\\n    // Alta incid\303\252ncia (+0.03)\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Infectologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'infectologia\',\\n        \'infectopediatria\',\\n        \'infeccao\',\\n        \'sepse\',\\n        \'hiv\',\\n        \'aids\',\\n        \'meningite\',\\n        \'endocardite\',\\n        \'sifilis\',\\n        \'hepatite viral\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Doen\303\247as End\303\252micas\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'doencas endemicas\',\\n        \'endemicas\',\\n        \'malaria\',\\n        \'dengue\',\\n        \'chagas\',\\n        \'hanseniase\',\\n        \'tuberculose\',\\n        \'leishmaniose\',\\n        \'arbovirose\',\\n        \'febre amarela\',\\n        \'leptospirose\',\\n        \'esquistossomose\',\\n        \'vigilancia em saude\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Neonatologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'neonatologia\',\\n        \'reanimacao neonatal\',\\n        \'ictericia neonatal\',\\n        \'sepse neonatal\',\\n        \'recem nascido\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Imuniza\303\247\303\265es\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'imunizacoes\',\\n        \'imunizacao\',\\n        \'vacinas\',\\n        \'vacinacao\',\\n        \'pni\',\\n        \'calendario vacinal\',\\n        \'puericultura imunizacoes\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Pr\303\251-Natal e Alto Risco\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'pre natal\',\\n        \'prenatal\',\\n        \'alto risco\',\\n        \'obstetricia pre natal\',\\n        \'diabetes mellitus gestacional\',\\n        \'diabetes gestacional\',\\n        \'dmg\',\\n        \'infeccoes congenitas\',\\n        \'isoimunizacao\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'S\303\255ndromes Hipertensivas\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'sindromes hipertensivas\',\\n        \'pre eclampsia\',\\n        \'eclampsia\',\\n        \'hellp\',\\n        \'dheg\',\\n        \'hipertensao gestacional\',\\n        \'obstetricia urgencias\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Aten\303\247\303\243o Prim\303\241ria e SUS\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'atencao primaria\',\\n        \'aps\',\\n        \'sus\',\\n        \'politicas de saude\',\\n        \'saude da familia\',\\n        \'esf\',\\n        \'saude coletiva\',\\n        \'medicina preventiva\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Epidemiologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'epidemiologia\',\\n        \'bioestatistica\',\\n        \'testes diagnosticos\',\\n        \'valores preditivos\',\\n        \'estudos epidemiologicos\',\\n        \'indicadores de saude\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Trauma e Abdome Agudo\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'trauma\',\\n        \'politraumatizado\',\\n        \'atls\',\\n        \'abdome agudo\',\\n        \'pneumotorax\',\\n        \'apendicite\',\\n        \'obstrucao intestinal\',\\n        \'colecistite\',\\n        \'pancreatite aguda\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Cardiologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'cardiologia\',\\n        \'sindrome coronariana\',\\n        \'iam\',\\n        \'iamcsst\',\\n        \'insuficiencia cardiaca\',\\n        \'hipertensao arterial\',\\n        \'arritmia\',\\n        \'fibrilacao atrial\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Endocrinologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'endocrinologia\',\\n        \'diabetes mellitus\',\\n        \'cetoacidose\',\\n        \'tireoide\',\\n        \'hipotireoidismo\',\\n        \'hipertireoidismo\',\\n        \'adrenal\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n\\n    // M\303\251dia incid\303\252ncia (0.00)\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Pneumologia\',\\n      tier: \'media\',\\n      delta: 0.0,\\n      keywords: [\'pneumologia\', \'asma\', \'dpoc\', \'pneumonia\', \'derrame pleural\', \'tep\'],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Nefrologia\',\\n      tier: \'media\',\\n      delta: 0.0,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'nefrologia\',\\n        \'injuria renal\',\\n        \'doenca renal cronica\',\\n        \'glomerulopatia\',\\n        \'disturbios hidroeletroliticos\',\\n        \'hipercalemia\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Hematologia\',\\n      tier: \'media\',\\n      delta: 0.0,\\n      keywords: [\'hematologia\', \'anemia\', \'leucemia\', \'linfoma\', \'coagulopatia\'],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Psiquiatria\',\\n      tier: \'media\',\\n      delta: 0.0,\\n      keywords: [\'psiquiatria\', \'depressao\', \'esquizofrenia\', \'transtorno bipolar\', \'ansiedade\'],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Gastroenterologia\',\\n      tier: \'media\',\\n      delta: 0.0,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'gastroenterologia\',\\n        \'cirrose\',\\n        \'hemorragia digestiva\',\\n        \'drge\',\\n        \'ulcera peptica\',\\n        \'doenca inflamatoria intestinal\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n  ],\\n\\n  ENARE: [\\n    // Baixa incid\303\252ncia (-0.03) \342\200\224 checked first for high-specificity subspecialties\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Oncologia Pedi\303\241trica\',\\n      tier: \'baixa\',\\n      delta: -0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'oncologia pediatrica\',\\n        \'oncopediatria\',\\n        \'neuroblastoma\',\\n        \'tumor de wilms\',\\n        \'retinoblastoma\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Doen\303\247as Metab\303\263licas Raras\',\\n      tier: \'baixa\',\\n      delta: -0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'doencas metabolicas raras\',\\n        \'erros inatos do metabolismo\',\\n        \'erro inato\',\\n        \'mucopolissacaridose\',\\n        \'doenca metabolica rara\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Oftalmologia e Otorrino\',\\n      tier: \'baixa\',\\n      delta: -0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'oftalmologia\',\\n        \'oftalmo\',\\n        \'otorrino\',\\n        \'otorrinolaringologia\',\\n        \'orl\',\\n        \'glaucoma\',\\n        \'catarata\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Cirurgia Pl\303\241stica\',\\n      tier: \'baixa\',\\n      delta: -0.03,\\n      keywords: [\'cirurgia plastica\', \'enxerto cutaneo\', \'retalho cirurgico\'],\\n    },\\n\\n    // Alta incid\303\252ncia (+0.03)\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Cardiologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'cardiologia\',\\n        \'sindrome coronariana\',\\n        \'iam\',\\n        \'iamcsst\',\\n        \'insuficiencia cardiaca\',\\n        \'hipertensao arterial\',\\n        \'arritmia\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Pneumologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\'pneumologia\', \'asma\', \'dpoc\', \'pneumonia\', \'derrame pleural\', \'tep\'],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Endocrinologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'endocrinologia\',\\n        \'diabetes mellitus\',\\n        \'cetoacidose\',\\n        \'tireoide\',\\n        \'hipotireoidismo\',\\n        \'hipertireoidismo\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Infectologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'infectologia\',\\n        \'infectopediatria\',\\n        \'sepse\',\\n        \'tuberculose\',\\n        \'hiv\',\\n        \'dengue\',\\n        \'meningite\',\\n        \'sifilis\',\\n        \'endocardite\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Trauma e Abdome Agudo\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'trauma\',\\n        \'politraumatizado\',\\n        \'atls\',\\n        \'abdome agudo\',\\n        \'pneumotorax\',\\n        \'apendicite\',\\n        \'obstrucao intestinal\',\\n        \'colecistite\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Assist\303\252ncia ao Parto\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'assistencia ao parto\',\\n        \'trabalho de parto\',\\n        \'partograma\',\\n        \'distocia\',\\n        \'hemorragia pos parto\',\\n        \'obstetricia urgencias\',\\n        \'parto\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'S\303\255ndromes Hipertensivas\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'sindromes hipertensivas\',\\n        \'pre eclampsia\',\\n        \'eclampsia\',\\n        \'hellp\',\\n        \'dheg\',\\n        \'hipertensao gestacional\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Anticoncep\303\247\303\243o e SUA\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'anticoncepcao\',\\n        \'contracepcao\',\\n        \'sua\',\\n        \'sangramento uterino anormal\',\\n        \'ginecologia\',\\n        \'mioma\',\\n        \'endometriose\',\\n        \'diu\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Neonatologia\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'neonatologia\',\\n        \'reanimacao neonatal\',\\n        \'ictericia neonatal\',\\n        \'sepse neonatal\',\\n        \'recem nascido\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Puericultura e Vacinas\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'puericultura\',\\n        \'vacinas\',\\n        \'imunizacoes\',\\n        \'imunizacao\',\\n        \'pni\',\\n        \'aleitamento materno\',\\n        \'crescimento e desenvolvimento\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'Epidemiologia e Bioestat\303\255stica\',\\n      tier: \'alta\',\\n      delta: 0.03,\\n      keywords: [\\n        \'epidemiologia\',\\n        \'bioestatistica\',\\n        \'testes diagnosticos\',\\n        \'valores preditivos\',\\n        \'estudos epidemiologicos\',\\n        \'vigilancia em saude\',\\n      ],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      topic: \'At