  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Pareto Profile**\n\nI\'m currently working on incorporating the Pareto 80/20 engine into `/src/components/flashcards/ExamWeightsModal.tsx`. My immediate focus is on computing the `paretoProfile` using `buildBoardParetoProfile`, leveraging the active board data, raw topics, and the BOARD_INCIDENCE_MATRIX for the active board. This will be the foundational piece.\n\n\n**Implementing Pareto Strip**\n\nI\'ve moved on to ordering topics by the `paretoProfile.orderedTopicIds`, ensuring the cumulative percentage increases smoothly. I\'m also adding a **Pareto Status Strip** beneath the board tabs. It will display the analysis status (enough data or not), showing question count and enabling \"Recalcular pelo Pareto do Banco\". The strip will feature a prominent button with a `BarChart3` icon for recalculation, which triggers `recalculateBoardWeightsFromPareto`, refreshes `localTick`, and updates weights via `onWeightsChange()`.\n\n\n"
