  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Dialogue Protocol**\n\nI\'m focusing on strictly adhering to the specified \"planning-mode\" rules for this initial turn. I\'m prioritizing interactive clarification and the disciplined use of \"ask_question.\" No premature implementation plans will be generated.\n\n\n**Refining User Questions**\n\nI\'m now formulating three focused multiple-choice questions for the user, concerning the heatmap\'s visual format. I\'m prioritizing clarity and relevance, considering the best heatmap layouts for representing exam frequency versus student performance. My aim is to extract crucial preferences via direct questioning. The goal is to obtain valuable information to start planning the next steps.\n\n\n**Validating Question Framework**\n\nI am confirming the \"ask_question\" formatting, ensuring plain text and concise options. My questions are simple, yet precise. I\'ve reevaluated the questions, ensuring the options are distinct and intuitive, and the recommended option is listed first as planned. I am now certain the format for questions and options meets the specified criteria.\n\n\n"
