    thinking: "**Pinpointing Artifact Directory**\n\nI\'ve just confirmed the exact Artifact Directory Path. It\'s located at `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/74e42f84-04ad-4718-bf3b-ea42d1d8cf3b`. This is crucial for determining the plan file\'s location, which I\'m currently working on.\n\n\n**Verifying Plan Requirements**\n\nI\'m now cross-referencing the specifications for `implementation_plan.md` within `planning-mode`. I need to ensure it meets all criteria, including a human-readable format, specifically in Brazilian Portuguese, with no file or folder listings. Furthermore, a detailed ASCII diagram representing the architecture and data flow, and all required sections like the User Review and Technical Architecture, must be included.\n\n\n"
