  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing the Plan**\n\nI\'m now in Phase 3, executing the approved plan! I\'m synthesizing the confirmed Phase 1 answers, specifically focusing on the visual format. I\'m developing a 2D matrix, Incidence x Question Volume. It\'ll have three rows for incidence (Alta/M\303\251dia/Baixa) and four columns (0-14q, 15-29q, 30-44q, 45+q).\n\n\n**Refining the Dashboard**\n\nI\'m now integrating the knowledge gap criteria: high incidence/low volume, or accuracy below 70%, will trigger a \"gap\" opening theme summary. The summary will have buttons for Questions and Flashcards. I\'m aiming for MedR1-matching aesthetics. I\'m also ensuring the new implementation uses existing data structures for consistency in incidence percentages, custom weights, and Pareto tiers. The dashboard is to include controls for rapid board switching.\n\n\n"
